g from Aug. 1969 through Aug. 1970, with a median of 381.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_58ed5f4255e14caf8835c61f","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"todo__todo_write","arguments":{"content":"- [x] Explore available Treasury Bulletin resources to understand data structure\n- [x] Extract U.S. savings bond sales data for July 1969–July 1970 period\n- [x] Extract U.S. savings bond sales data for August 1969–August 1970 period\n- [x] Calculate median nominal sales (all series combined) for each period\n- [x] Round to nearest million dollars\n- [x] Compare and return highest median value\n- [ ] Write answer to /app/answer.txt"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"todo"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
